{"subindexId":3587,"title":{"en":"Dua-e-Tawaaf","rurdu":"Dua-e-Tawaaf","urdu":"دُعاء طواف"},"lines":[{"id":1015867,"type":"text","seq":null,"desc":{"en":"One can divide a supplication recommended for circumambulation and read a part of it in each round so that he will not have a doubt.","rurdu":"Behtar hai keh dua ko saat (7) hisso mein taqseem kare aur har ek chakkar mein ek hisse ko adaa kare ta-keh tawaaf ki ginti mein shak o shuba na ho.","urdu":"بہتر ہے کہ دعا کو ۷ حصوں میں تقسیم کریں اور ہر ایک چکر میں ایک حصہ کو ادا کریں تا کہ طواف کی گنتی میں شک و شبہ نہ ہو۔"}},{"id":1015868,"type":"text","seq":1,"desc":{"en":"Dua for <1st Round>","rurdu":"<1st Chakkar> ki dua","urdu":"<پہلا چکر>"}},{"id":1015869,"type":"text","seq":2,"desc":{"en":"Dua for <2nd Round>","rurdu":"<2nd Chakkar> ki dua","urdu":"<دوسرا چکر>"}},{"id":1015870,"type":"text","seq":3,"desc":{"en":"Dua for <3rd Round>","rurdu":"<3rd Chakkar> ki dua","urdu":"<تیسرا چکر>"}},{"id":1015871,"type":"text","seq":4,"desc":{"en":"Dua for <4th Round>","rurdu":"<4th Chakkar> ki dua","urdu":"<چوتھا چکر>"}},{"id":1015872,"type":"text","seq":5,"desc":{"en":"Dua for <5th Round>","rurdu":"<5th Chakkar> ki dua","urdu":"<پانچواں چکر>"}},{"id":1015873,"type":"text","seq":6,"desc":{"en":"Dua for <6th Round>","rurdu":"<6th Chakkar> ki dua","urdu":"<چھٹا چکر>"}},{"id":1015874,"type":"text","seq":7,"desc":{"en":"Dua for <7th Round>","rurdu":"<7th Chakkar> ki dua","urdu":"<ساتواں چکر>"}},{"id":4,"type":"text","seq":null}]}